---
// Category shelf: a plain-language introduction instead of tiles. Shelf names
// are set stronger inline so the list scans at a glance without cards.
---

<section class="categories" id="categories" aria-labelledby="categories-heading">
  <div class="section-head reveal">
    <h2 id="categories-heading">Start with a category</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">
      Everything on NyasaBuy is sorted into eight simple shelves. Browse
      <span class="shelf">phones and electronics</span>,
      <span class="shelf">fashion</span>,
      <span class="shelf">groceries and food</span>,
      <span class="shelf">home and kitchen</span>,
      <span class="shelf">health and beauty</span>,
      <span class="shelf">baby and toys</span>,
      <span class="shelf">sports and outdoors</span> or
      <span class="shelf">office and school supplies</span>.
    </p>
    <p class="section-note">Every shelf is stocked by trusted sellers across Malawi.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .categories {
    padding: clamp(2.25rem, 6vw, 4rem) 0;
  }

  .section-head {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-head h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.6vw, 1.875rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  /* Short accent bar under the heading: marks this section without
     reintroducing card furniture. */
  .section-head h2::after {
    content: "";
    display: block;
    width: 44px;
    height: 3px;
    margin: 0.875rem auto 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--navy);
  }

  .section-intro {
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 1.125rem auto 0;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--body);
  }

  /* Shelf names carry the brand navy so the list can be scanned mid-sentence. */
  .shelf {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--navy);
  }

  .section-note {
    margin: 1.125rem auto 0;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--body);
  }
</style>
